<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In It Depends: Resolving Referential Ambiguity in Minimal Contexts with Commonsense Knowledge" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Ablation: Permutation of Entity Ordering</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In It Depends: Resolving Referential Ambiguity in Minimal Contexts with Commonsense Knowledge" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Response Categorization</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In It Depends: Resolving Referential Ambiguity in Minimal Contexts with Commonsense Knowledge" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Automatic Evaluation</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A7" title="In It Depends: Resolving Referential Ambiguity in Minimal Contexts with Commonsense Knowledge" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G </span>Direct Preference Optimization</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
<div id="infobox" class="infobox">
