</section>
<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>Direct Preference Optimization</h2>

<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Our training set contains 472 responses from simple settings and 866 from normal settings. In addition, we included 30 basic clarification cases, where the user posed clearly ambiguous questions. A fine-grained distribution is provided in <a href="#A7.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix G Direct Preference Optimization ‣ It Depends: Resolving Referential Ambiguity in Minimal Contexts with Commonsense Knowledge" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table 6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
